update('types','AVRIPEMD',{'fields':{'transform':{'ptr':pointer(lifetime='static',nullable=True,mutable=False,note='av_mallocz leaves NULL before initialization. Supported init bits install one static ripemd128/160/256/320_transform; update invokes it with the inline state[10] and 64-byte block only for the call. No callback cookie, retained data or ownership transfer. Invalid init bits change digest_len before returning EINVAL and must not become safe initialized state.')}},'_comment_agent':'Public header is opaque; ripemd.c private body owns no suballocations. Alloc av_mallocz actual sizeof AVRIPEMD, released with av_freep via hash.c av_hash_freep and av_free in tests. Full storage remains C allocated. Only supported init 128/160/256/320 publishes an initialized owner, with static transform. No known C cloner or disposer. Dedicated ffibox RipemdFree policy delegates existing Heap CDrop and does not provide generic allocation of the incomplete binding; no inline constructor or CZeroable; no Send/Sync asserted.'})
