codex
The wrappers pass ASan/UBSan, TSan, the two targeted BSan reborrow tests, and the FFI-free Miri tests. Coverage reaches all measured RC4 lines and all measured C lines in both files; RIPEMD’s only Rust misses are a defensive cleanup branch that the matching C implementation cannot reach.
The workspace’s compile-fail gate also exposed pre-existing diagnostic-snapshot drift when Rust standard-library sources are visible. I’m leaving those unrelated snapshots unchanged.
